y for Personal Systems at HP Inc., comments:\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e\"We were delighted to see AV-TEST's independent report, verifying that HP's NGAV performs at the highest level. Small and mid-sized organizations are targeted by increasingly sophisticated threats, especially as attacks are being supercharged by AI, which can have a devastating impact on firms operating with limited resources. By offering NGAV as part of the {{HP_WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}} suite, our layered approach helps organizations mitigate security risks and streamline IT operations, while providing a user-friendly experience. This means they can guard against a wider range of cyber threats.\"\u003c/2\u003e","avTestBadgeAdvancedAlt":"Advanced endpoint protection certificate from AV-TEST.","avTestBadgeAlt":"Corporate endpoint protection top product certificate from AV-TEST.","categories":"\u003c0\u003eThe AV-Test report evaluates antivirus products based on three critical categories:\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e\u003c0\u003eProtection: Assessing the ability of the antivirus to safeguard against malware and various cyber threats.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ePerformance: Measuring the speed and efficiency of the antivirus software across different systems.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eUsability: Tracking false alarms and assessing the overall user experience, particularly concerning internet usage.\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e{{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}'s Next Generation Antivirus has achieved an outstanding overall score of 18 out of 18, with a perfect rating of 6 in each category:\u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eProtection: \u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e6\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003ePerformance: \u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e6\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eUsability: \u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e6\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c/3\u003e\u003c4\u003eWith this prestigious recognition from AV-Test, {{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}'s Antivirus emerges as one of the most robust solutions available in the market, offering superb security for PC endpoints at an affordable cost.\u003c/4\u003e","keyFeatures":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003eThreat Containment: Leveraging Isolation Technology, this unique feature effectively shields users from phishing attempts, zero-day exploits, ransomware, and unknown malware attacks.\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eSecure Browser: Preventing malicious links from compromising PC security, ensuring safe browsing experiences.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eCredential Protection: Safeguarding login credentials from potential threats posed by malicious websites.\u003c/2\u003e\u003c3\u003eNext Generation Antivirus: Top-rated Antivirus, delivers advanced protection against evolving cyber threats.\u003c/3\u003e\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e{{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}'s comprehensive approach helps organizations mitigate security risks, streamline IT operations, and provides a user-friendly experience, ensuring robust PC protection with minimal complexity making it an efficient and cost-effective solution for SMB and Midmarket customers.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003eExplore our purchasing options and secure your PC with \u003c2\u003e{{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}\u003c/2\u003e today.\u003c/2\u003e","keyFeaturesTitle":"\u003c0\u003eKey features of \u003c2\u003e{{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}\u003c/2\u003e\u003c/0\u003e","plansButton":"Explore {{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}} purchasing options","subtitle":"AV-TEST awards perfect score","text":"\u003c0\u003e\u003c0\u003eAV-Test\u003c/0\u003e, a leading independent IT security research institute, has officially announced on 2 April 2024 that {{HP_WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}'s Next Generation Antivirus as one of the best\u003c4\u003e\u003c0\u003eWindows Antivirus Software for Business users\u003c/0\u003e\u003c/4\u003e in the antivirus category (Corporate Endpoint Protection - Top Product). The \u003c8\u003e\u003c0\u003ecomprehensive report\u003c/0\u003e\u003c/8\u003e highlights {{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}}'s Antivirus as excelling across all tested areas, earning the highest scores possible in Protection, Performance, and Usability.\u003c/0\u003e","title":"{{ HP_WOLF_PRO_SECURITY }} leads in next generation antivirus test","wpsTitle":"\u003c0\u003e{{WOLF_PRO_SECURITY}} provides a comprehensive suite of solutions aimed at fortifying organizations against a wide range of cyber threats that other popular solutions can't.\u003c/0\u003e"},"AVTestMeta":{"description":"{{ HP_WOLF_PRO_SECURITY }} is awarded a perfect score by the AV-TEST independent IT security institute, ranking it with the best-in-class for antivirus products.","title":"AV-Test"},"Buy":{"buy":"Buy","heading":"Reinforce your first line of defense"},"BuyMeta":{"description":"Don't let cyber threats get the best of you. Reinforce your first line of defence against malware and cyberattacks with HP Wolf Security.","title":"Buy"},"CaseStudy":{"caption":"Listen to Tyler Timek at Masonicare discuss how \"HP Sure Click Enterprise does what no other product does\": protect his fleet of PCs and healthcare systems with a small team, allowing him to \"sleep at night.\"","videoAlt":"Testimonial from Tyler Timek at Masonicare","watchVideoButton":"Watch video"},"common":{"aboutUs":"About Us","address":"Address","blog":"Blog","buy":"Buy","careers":"Careers","close":"Close","contactHp":"Contact HP","copyrightNotice":"© Copyright {{year}} HP Development Company, L.P.","download":"Download","dropdownAbout":"About","dropdownCaseStudy":"Case Study","facebookIcon":"Facebook icon","hpLogoImageAlt":"HP Logo in black and white","instagram":"Instagram icon","latestRelease":"Latest Release","level2Certified":"L2 Certified","level3Certified":"L3 Certified","linkedin":"LinkedIn icon","loginButton":"Log in","more":"More","nDaysAgo_one":"{{count}} day ago","nDaysAgo_other":"{{count}} days ago","noPartner":"My country is not listed","privacy":"Privacy","products":"Products","requestTrial":"Request trial","requestTrialButton":"Request trial","salesContact":"Sales contact","securityCenter":"Security Center","serviceStatus":"Service Status","sideMenuAriaLabel":"Toggle navigation menu","signInButton":"Sign in","stayConnected":"Stay Connected","support":"Support","supportCenter":"Support Center","supportContact":"Support contact","tel":"Tel","today":"Today","twitter":"Twitter icon","upcomingRelease":"Upcoming release","useOfCookies":"Use of cookies","website":"Website","whatsNew":"What's new?","whatsNewQ":"What's new?","whatsNewWith":"What's new with {{APP_NAME}}","youtube":"YouTube icon"},"Countries":{"broadbandTitle":"\u003c0\u003eWolf Connect using the \u003c1\u003eBroadband (WWAN, 4G or 5G)\u003c/1\u003e cards are not supported in the following countries and territories:\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eAngola, Belarus, Belize, Benin, Bhutan, Burkina Faso, Central African Republic, Chad, Congo Democratic Republic, Cuba, Equatorial Guinea, Eritrea, Guinea, Guinea-Bissau, Iran, Laos, Libya, Mayotte, Mongolia, New Caledonia, North Korea, Palestine, Rwanda, Russia, Sao Tome and Principe, Serbia and Montenegro, Somalia, South Sudan, Swaziland, Syria, Turkmenistan, Uganda, Ukrainian Regions: Crimea, Donetsk, Luhansk; US Virgin Islands, Venezuela, Wallis and Futuna, Yemen, and Zimbabwe.\u003c/1\u003e","countriesText":"\u003c0\u003eProtect \u0026 Trace with Wolf Connect uses the global cellular network for connectivity to target PCs. In some countries and territories such access is not available, usually for regulatory reasons or due to lack of the required cellular standards. The tables below detail where cellular support is not available for Wolf Connect. These lists might change over time as conditions change in the relevant locations.\u003c/0\u003e \u003c2\u003eTwo lists are provided: one for the Mobile Narrowband (MNB) card, and one for the broadband (WWAN 4G or 5G) cards. A single target PC can only support one card or the other. However a fleet of PCs can include a mix of card types, as the cellular connectivity choice is transparent to the higher level applications. Also note that some HP PCs do not support 5G, see the \u003c2\u003ePlatforms\u003c/2\u003e page for details.\u003c/2\u003e","mobileNarrowbandText":"\u003c0\u003eWolf Connect using the \u003c1\u003eMobile Narrowband (MNB)\u003c/1\u003e card is not supported in the following countries and territories:\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003eBelarus, Benin, British Virgin Islands, Burkina Faso, Central African Republic, Chad, Congo Democratic Republic, Cuba, Eritrea, Gambia, Guinea-Bissau, Iran, Laos, Macao Special Admini, Mayotte, Monaco, New Caledonia, North Korea, Russia, Sao Tome and Principe, Syria, Serbia and Montenegro, Singapore, Somalia, South Korea, Swaziland, Thailand, Ukrainian Regions: Crimea, Donetsk, Luhansk; United Arab Emirates, US Virgin Islands, and Wallis and Futuna.\u003c/1\u003e","notesSection":"\u003c0\u003eNotes:\u003c/0\u003e\u003c1\u003e1. Protect and Trace with Wolf Connect uses both cellular and internet-based methods to communicate between the TechPulse management platform and the target PC. This means that even if the PC is in a country which is listed as \"non-supported\" above, if that PC has internet access (and the country isn't blocking access to TechPulse), the solution will still function normally. Communication will be over the internet, using the Wi-Fi or hard Ethernet interfaces on the PC.\u003c/1\u003e\u003c2\u003e2. Because of Note 1, if a PC has 4G/5G WWAN hardware, and the customer has an operational mobile/cellular subscription that provides internet to the PC, the P\u0026T/WC solution will still work in a location on the unsupported lists above.\u003c/2\u003e"},"CountriesHero":{"heading":"Country/Territory Support for Cellular Connectivity"},"CountriesMeta":{"description":"HP Wolf Protect and Trace prov